# 基本図形編集の道具パネル (design 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py: its buttons and palettes
# are parts of panels the window manager draws. The figure 画用紙 is opened: there is no room
# for its panel under it or over it, so the panel stands whole at the top of the screen (0).
# It is carried by its band down to 104 (outer); its buttons, 32 square, stand from 112,137
# 34 apart, the second row from 171. The rectangle template is taken (in hand: the heavy
# edge), taken again (drawing from the middle: the red mark), and a rectangle drawn. The
# palettes come up under their buttons: 線色 with the red of its swatches (the rectangle's
# lines red), 塗りつぶし with one of the fixed patterns (its inside filled with it), 角丸
# with 10 typed into its box and Enter; each put away with Escape. Last, 塗りつぶし's
# 〈パターン編集...〉 opens the pattern editor.
open 019a0f91-066f-706f-93da-ffe8150d6207
wait 2500
win 画用紙
drag 300 10 300 114
wait 400
shot ftool_panel
# 長方形, then drawing from the middle
click 298 187
wait 300
shot ftool_rect
click 298 187
wait 300
shot ftool_centre
click 298 187
drag 450 450 600 560
wait 400
# 線色: red
click 162 153
wait 400
shot ftool_stroke
click 358 227
wait 300
key 29
wait 300
# 塗りつぶし: a pattern
click 128 153
wait 400
shot ftool_fill
click 168 310
wait 300
key 29
wait 300
# 角丸: 10
click 230 153
wait 400
key 2a
key 1e
key 27
key 28
wait 400
shot ftool_done
# the other palettes come up and go
click 196 153
wait 400
shot ftool_lstyle
key 29
wait 300
click 332 153
wait 400
shot ftool_zoom
key 29
wait 300
click 366 153
wait 400
shot ftool_grid
key 29
wait 300
click 468 187
wait 400
shot ftool_font
key 29
wait 300
# 〈パターン編集...〉 from 塗りつぶし
click 128 153
wait 400
click 190 403
expect pattern: opened
wait 500
win パターン編集
shot ftool_pattern
